        "observed_version": "Verilator 5.052 / Icarus 13.0",
        "phase": "execute",
        "reason": "Verilator 5.052 resets a static output-only function argument when an early return leaves it unassigned. IEEE 1800-2023 6.21/13.4.2 give function arguments static lifetime, and 13.5 copies output values to actuals on return. The standalone source returns 0 after a previous call assigned 37; Celox retains 37.",
