      "category": "ControlFlow",
      "detail": "Verilator 5.052 and Icarus 13.0 reset a static function result on calls that do not assign it (0 for bit, X for logic in Icarus). IEEE 1800-2023 13.4.1 declares an implicit result variable, and 6.21/13.4.2 give it static lifetime. The standalone source reproduces the reset without the suite adapters. Celox retains the previous value.",
      "expectation": "Simulation",
      "known_issue": {
        "category": "simulator_disagreement",
        "evidence": [
          "verification/repros/sv_static_function_lifetimes.json",
