          "LIMITATIONS.md#systemverilog-suite"
        ],
        "id": "sv_static_function_result_lifetime",
        "observed_version": "Verilator 5.052 / Icarus 13.0",
        "phase": "execute",
        "reason": "Verilator 5.052 and Icarus 13.0 reset a static function result on calls that do not assign it (0 for bit, X for logic in Icarus). IEEE 1800-2023 13.4.1 declares an implicit result variable, and 6.21/13.4.2 give it static lifetime. The standalone source reproduces the reset without the suite adapters. Celox retains the previous value.",
